notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T20:42:27.443Z",pi-agent,"Evidence: The two actionable unknown-author events are _workspace:1 (op config:set:governance.duplicate_detection_mode, ts 2026-07-25T12:08:10.403Z) and _workspace:2 (op config:set:parent_reference_policy, ts 2026-07-25T12:23:39.710Z). git log -S traced both to commit ec7c1ab 'chore(governance): enable duplicate-detection advisory mode and adopt pm-cli 2026.7.25 (#29)' authored by Steve Preu <stefan@preu.at>. Attribution acknowledged via append-only audit event in _workspace.jsonl. Note: pm history-author-acknowledge has a regex bug that rejects _workspace (starts with _), so the SDK appendWorkspaceAuditEvent function was called directly to produce the identical audit event."
